 • I did not execute the physical/simulated pick-and-place, and I did not bypass
   the audited Forge tool path by manually POSTing the plan/execute gateway     
   endpoints.                                                                   
 • The AgentTask remains non-terminal (no motion was ever admitted).            

Recommended fix (one line, then rerun officially)                               

In PhyAgentOS/forge/tool_client.py, raise the default client timeout to cover   
perception latency, e.g.                                                        

                                                                                
 def __init__(self, base_url, *, timeout_s: float = 180.0, transport=None):     
                                                                                

(or make it configurable), then restart PAOS + the rekep-sim runtime. After     
that, the standard forge_tool_query → forge_tool_start_action →                 
forge_tool_action_result sequence will complete and return the MP4.             

